posts.body:
Great plugin. Just want to say, that it looks like there is slight order bug. RPG MAKER MV
When Pressing the arrow button in skill tree menu (while having 3 skill trees) you´ll get to another skill tree than pressing the "w" or "RB" button. I changed the code in line 19978 to 19999 with the following and now it´s working:
_updateKeyboardGamepadControls() {
if (!this.isMoreThenOneCategory()) {
return;
}
if (PKD_SimpleSkillsTree.Utils.IsGlobalModalState()) {
return;
}
if (this._inputDelay !== 0) {
return;
}
if (Input.isTriggered(this.uiConstant('nextCategoryButton'))) {
KDCore.Utils.playSE(this.uiConstant('categoryChangeSound'));
this.prevCategoryClick();  // Swapped to fix order
Input.clear();
this._startInputDelay();
} else if (Input.isTriggered(this.uiConstant('prevCategoryButton'))) {
KDCore.Utils.playSE(this.uiConstant('categoryChangeSound'));
this.nextCategoryClick();  // Swapped to fix order
Input.clear();
this._startInputDelay();
}
}
